+## Hasil nyata dan perubahan assertion
+
+- API macOS/Python 3.13.5, PostgreSQL 16.15, DB
+  `maaher_test_security_final_3`: **67 passed, 1 warning in 71.12s**.
+- Linux/Python 3.12, DB `maaher_test_security_linux_3`, user nonroot,
